ctions","description":"Recommended Actions is a context-aware recommendation framework that displays relevant, actionable guidance to users directly within workspaces based on the context of the record they are working on. It acts as a one‑stop experience that combines contextual actions, guided decisions, rule-based and AI-driven recommendations, and AI Search to help users resolve issues faster and more consistently across workflows.","locale":"en-US","release":"australia","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-04-16","reading_time_minutes":5,"tags":["#customer-relationship-management","#crm","#accounts","#contacts","#opportunities","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/customer-relationship-management/customer-relationship-management/crm-recommended-actions.md"},
